1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,552
A legislative aide came to the campus in a purple coat and asked to see the map.

2
00:00:04,552 --> 00:00:10,956
She stared at the wall for a long minute, her gaze moving from the gate to the legend.

3
00:00:10,956 --> 00:00:25,003
“The potential is obvious,” she said, “but this is controversial, and the council will not fund a hazy promise.” The sheer enthusiasm of the volunteers met a cold room.

4
00:00:25,003 --> 00:00:38,041
A funny detail softened nothing: the lady from the council had arrived with a cigaret she was not allowed to light, and she held it like a small, useless tool.

5
00:00:38,041 --> 00:00:46,544
The condition was stated precisely: show a working bypass for every closed gate, or lose the room.

6
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:53,562
An enthusiastic volunteer asked whether a sketch would do; he was told that it would not.

7
00:00:53,562 --> 00:00:58,686
“That is amazing,” Maya said, meaning the opposite.

8
00:00:58,686 --> 00:01:04,400
“It is also impossible.” The shock was that the aide agreed.

9
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:14,613
Those five buildings were, normally, the least interesting part of the campus, and yet the whole project now depended on them.

10
00:01:14,613 --> 00:01:18,343
The delay began to weaken their hold on the room.

11
00:01:18,343 --> 00:01:26,076
A brutal deadline can sharpen a design or terrify its makers; this one did both.

12
00:01:26,076 --> 00:01:30,760
They worked in a muddy room that began to darken at four o'clock.

13
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:35,034
The mist outside was thick enough to hide the far gate.

14
00:01:35,034 --> 00:01:43,438
A creamy soup and a delicious bun arrived, and the volunteers ate standing up, usually in silence.

15
00:01:43,438 --> 00:01:49,941
“This is disgusting,” one girl said, meaning the corridor rather than the food.

16
00:01:49,941 --> 00:02:01,489
Small delays began to annoy everyone, including the two of them, and a bloody scratch on Lin's hand came from fastening the board to the wall.

17
00:02:01,489 --> 00:02:08,992
Among the three hundred notes, a hundred mentioned a lack of light and an equal amount mentioned the cold.

18
00:02:08,992 --> 00:02:21,195
A colorful diagram fascinated the visitors, and the fascination was mutual: the students were in awe of the aide's patience, and she was in awe of their stamina.

19
00:02:21,195 --> 00:02:24,689
Both of them watched her read the whole file.

20
00:02:24,689 --> 00:02:29,488
“Do not deceive yourselves,” she said at last.

21
00:02:29,488 --> 00:02:32,793
“Urbanization is not your problem.

22
00:02:32,793 --> 00:02:41,601
Access is.” An awesome responsibility, Lin thought, for one thin folder.

23
00:02:41,601 --> 00:02:46,540
The overthrow of their own first plan necessitated a new method.

24
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:55,688
They fastened the map to a board, sharpened the wording, and built an adaptive and innovative version that could be edited in an hour.

25
00:02:55,688 --> 00:03:03,671
The potentiality was real and the excitement was also real, which horrified Professor Zhao slightly.

26
00:03:03,671 --> 00:03:26,761
“Yeah,” Lin said, “but a positive attitude does not improve a locked door, and patience alone will not pay for one.” “Instead of defending the room,” he went on, “we should defend the route.” “Yes,” said the aide, “and that is precisely why I am still here.”
